> <P><FONT COLOR="#990000"># route add -net 16.66.80 16.66.80.205 1</FONT>
> <BR><FONT COLOR="#990000">old usage of trailing digit, assuming route via
> gateway</FONT>
> <BR><FONT COLOR="#990000">add net 16.66.80: gateway 16.66.80.205</FONT><FONT COLOR="#990000"></FONT>
>
> <P><FONT COLOR="#990000"># ping 16.66.80.2</FONT>
> <BR><FONT COLOR="#990000">PING 16.66.80.2 (16.66.80.2): 56 data bytes</FONT>
> <BR><FONT COLOR="#990000">64 bytes from 16.66.80.2: icmp_seq=0 ttl=254
> time=304 ms</FONT>
> <BR><FONT COLOR="#990000">64 bytes from 16.66.80.2: icmp_seq=1 ttl=254
> time=303 ms</FONT>
> <BR><FONT COLOR="#990000">64 bytes from 16.66.80.2: icmp_seq=2 ttl=254
> time=302 ms</FONT>
