Add static routes to host/net2 using the IP address of each of the
routers.  If they are CISCO routers, add a HSRP address to the routers
and use this as the default gateway.

interface 0.0.0
ipaddress=aaa.bbb.ccc.ddd
standby ipaddress=aaa.bbb.ccc.(ddd+100)

standby ipaddress is the same on both routers.




