: to how to give this a push would be most welcome (perhaps some pr
: on the decus.org web server ?)

Now that I've given my rant, I want to thank everybody for the comments
they've been posting on this thread.  Between this and some private
conversations I've had recently, this old DEC admin has been able to keep
some sanity while working daily with HP-UX at my current customer site.  If
you've ever worked with HP-UX, you'd understand why my rant comes so easily
at the moment, and why I truly hate the trend away from Tru64 (and in
general most Unix) workstations towards NT...

