>Our system is running DU 3.2C and we have a RAID0
>domain with two volumes consisting of 2 and 3
>RZ29B disks resp. The problem is that the system
>reports that there is no enough space in the
>device while the domain is only 30% full. What
>could be the cause of this? and what should I do
